emulator_trace_ref:
source: "Locality/NMOS & VZ80REMIX transistor-level NMOS Z80 simulator (3.546895MHz half-T settled logs)"
key_findings:
- "Standard operand read = 3.0T (845.81ns): ULAT opens DLATCH at T2 rising, /WAIT at T2 falling, closes at T3 rising"
- "HALT trace (2/0..4/1) proves ULAT/ULATO level-sensitive pass-gate resampling DB while UWAIT loops on /WAIT=0"
- "ADDER=input/addr-out latch (ADDR=ADDER on x/0), ADDES=ripple output latch (NOPLD/INCLD/DECLD on x/0, commit x/1)"
- "LD (nn),A merges W=A|F at 5/1, overwrites W=A at 13/1, WZ=(A<<8)|((nn+1)&0xFF); IN A,(n) uses 5H /IORQ"
- "CALL cc,nn late-tests cc at 12/1 wasting 13/0..14/1 on false cc (replaced by 0.5T/1.5T 0WS early-cancel in ISA-1)"
- "ADD/ADC/SBC HL,RR runs 2x 8b ALU passes & writes WZ=HL+1; RLD/RRD uses NIBB-REV-BUS; IM0/1/2 & NMI suppress PC inc"
